      "bullets": [
        "Initiatives target migrating critical C/C++ FOSS codebases to Rust or Go to eliminate spatial and temporal memory safety bugs.",
        "Adoption favors incremental migration using C-compatible ABIs and FFI layers over full rewrites to avoid breaking downstream consumers.",
        "Prossimo and OpenSSF provide direct funding and tooling, aligning with CISA and White House memory-safety mandates."
      ]
    },
